🚀 E-Commerce Customer Behavior & Revenue Insights | Power BI Dashboard Project
This is an interactive Power BI dashboard analyzing an E-commerce Customer Behavior dataset sourced from Kaggle.
This project focused on transforming raw customer transaction data into meaningful business insights by exploring demographic trends, membership impact, and revenue distribution across cities.

Key Highlights from the Analysis:
• Male customers generated higher overall revenue, with stronger average spending levels.
• 28-year-old male customers represented a high-value demographic segment.
• Gold membership tier alone accounted for over 50% of total revenue, demonstrating the strong impact of loyalty programs.
• Spending patterns varied significantly across age groups, with notable divergence at age 31.
• Revenue concentration was observed across specific cities, highlighting geographic performance differences.

Skills Applied:
• Data transformation & cleaning
• KPI development using DAX
• Interactive dashboard design in Power BI
• Customer segmentation analysis
• Revenue performance evaluation
• Insight-driven storytelling

Kaggle datset link : https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/uom190346a/e-commerce-customer-behavior-dataset
